\begin_layout Section
Contribution
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This thesis presents a technique for finding algorithmic improvements to
 a previously developed expert program using genetic programming.
 Experts strategy is used as an anchor point for better interpretability,
 which is a novel approach in the field of XAI 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "fehrer_hein_tokic_udluft_2020"
literal "true"

\end_inset

.
 The scope of the extensions is calculated using the tree edit distance
 so that the candidates have stronger similarity to the original strategy.
 To further protect the familiarity in the extensions, techniques such as
 defining a fixed core structure or tree unification are implemented.
 
\end_layout

