\begin_layout Standard
For this work, a genetic programming framework was developed with particular
 emphasis on runtime.
 The fitness computation is inspired by Staats et al.
 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "karooGPpaper"
literal "true"

\end_inset

, who were able to achieve a 2-15x speedup by converting expressions to
 TensorFlow graphs, allowing parallel evaluation on the GPU.
 Furthermore, to avoid unnecessary calculations, the expressions are simplified
 before evaluation using symbolic mathematics, for which the Python library
 SymPy 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "10.7717/peerj-cs.103"
literal "true"

\end_inset

 was extended.
 The individuals are implemented as recursive tree structures, which is
 a more memory-efficient and also performant alternative compared to using
 arrays, since the recursive organization eliminates the need for separate
 reordering of nodes.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
The runtime increased by a further 50% in all runs in addition to the TensorFlow
-enabled evaluation, and the memory consumption was reduced to 
\begin_inset ERT
