\begin_layout Standard
Automatic equation cancellation replaces computable branches with their
 outcome.
 This process can shorten a long process of random mutations, but is only
 applied to the best performing individuals, as complex branches provide
 more junctions for mutation of innovative new gene structures.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In the following, a tree unification is presented, which simplifies and
 also restructures a tree accordingly to a unique ordered scheme (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand formatted
reference "fig:sympy-ordered-expression"

\end_inset

).
 In familiarity-based GP, unification is arguably more important than simplifica
tion because it strongly influences TED, which cannot account for mathematical
 similarities.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
E.g.
 sums are commutative 
\begin_inset Formula $(a+b)=(b+a)$
\end_inset

, but the TED can still be 2.
\end_layout

\end_inset

 
\end_layout

