).
 This is also confirmed by the results found by Hein in 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "daniel_hein_doktorarbeit"
literal "true"

\end_inset

, where the regression error also did not fall significantly below a limit
 of 2.
 This means that the PSONN black box policy could not be sufficiently approximat
ed.
 No significant improvement could be expected from any candidate run, so
 they could all have been discarded without online evaluation.
 In the familiar version, this could additionally have been detected at
 the beginning, where the high regression error of the initial strategy
 indicated that the differences to the PSONN policy might be too substantial.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
