\begin_layout Plain Layout
A conceivable classification of operators.
 Many operators can be replaced within their function group with sibling
 operators.
 Conceivable would be to see the operators only as representatives of their
 family or to implement associative and commutative operators as combined
 operators.
 Many tasks can be created sufficiently with only a subgroup of operators.
